<title>UK: Deutsche Bank unit sets 300 mln Danish crown bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank unit sets 300 mln Danish crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank Finance NV has launched a 300 million Danish crown domestic bond via joint lead managers Nykredit and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p>The bond pays a coupon of 4.0 percent and matures on August 15, 2005.  All other details are undisclosed.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
